@BmiApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

### Calcular el IMC enviando el cuerpo en JSON
POST {{BmiApi_HostAddress}}/api/bmi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weightKg": 70,
  "heightM": 1.75
}

### Calcular el IMC por query string
GET {{BmiApi_HostAddress}}/api/bmi?weightKg=70&heightM=1.75
Accept: application/json

### Datos fuera de rango: devuelve 400
POST {{BmiApi_HostAddress}}/api/bmi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weightKg": 0,
  "heightM": 1.75
}
